window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-041-7bb72f2d73dd7c03.json"]={sha256:"7bb72f2d73dd7c03426e22717b7e2f3e3aacff2a4ee5db18eb822522a08bd423",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-84367333215d0635","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/oai-system-liquid-cooling-guidelines-in-ocp-template-mar-3-2023-update-pdf","title":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","titleEn":"OAI System Liquid Cooling Guidelines","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-041","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-041","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-042","referenceUrls":["https://instinct.docs.amd.com/projects/dc-design/latest/index.html"],"title":"DLC 混合冷卻：殘餘空氣熱負載","titleEn":"Hybrid DLC cooling: residual heat assigned to air cooling","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兩個工作點、分段壓降、單位表與泵壓下降的替代案例；只在離線模型調整參數；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both operating points, component losses, units and an alternative reduced-head case. Parameter changes occur only in the offline model, with no instructions to adjust physical cooling equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"列出元件、發熱、液冷份額與空氣份額；將 PSU 損失是否已含於 IT 邊界註明，避免重複加算。","differenceEn":"List components, heat, liquid fraction and air fraction. State whether power-supply losses are already inside the IT boundary so they cannot be added twice to the room-air requirement.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學固定壓頭 H 與二次阻力模型為 H=(K1+K2)q²，因此 q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2))；真實泵浦曲線與流態需另建模；H=100 kPa，K 單位 kPa/(L/min)²；K1=1，K2 由 3 增為 8；名義式 sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min；變更式 sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","固定 IT 發熱 P、液冷捕獲率 f 時，殘餘空氣熱量為 P(1-f)；f 必須按同一熱邊界定義；教學機架 IT 發熱 160 kW；液冷捕獲率由 80% 下降到 70%，不含房間其他設備；名義式 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat；變更式 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With a fixed teaching head H and quadratic resistance, H=(K1+K2)q², giving q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2)). Real pump curves, fluid properties and flow regimes require separate characterization. Set H to 100 kPa and express K in kPa/(L/min)². K1 remains 1 while K2 increases from 3 to 8. These invented coefficients represent an educational operating-point model, not an OCP product curve. Nominal sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min; changed sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For fixed IT heat P and liquid capture fraction f, residual air heat is P(1-f). Define both terms over the same boundary; a capture fraction for processors alone cannot represent all rack heat. A synthetic rack produces 160 kW of IT heat. Liquid capture falls from 80% to 70%, excluding other room equipment and facility losses from the stated boundary. Nominal 160*(1-0.8) = 32 kW air heat; changed 160*(1-0.7) = 48 kW air heat. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-051","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/gromacs/gromacs/blob/main/docs/user-guide/mdrun-performance.rst"],"title":"GROMACS：PME 分工與科學精度下的負載平衡","titleEn":"GROMACS: PME partitioning under a scientific accuracy contract","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付兩個工作點、分段壓降、單位表與泵壓下降的替代案例；只在離線模型調整參數；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both operating points, component losses, units and an alternative reduced-head case. Parameter changes occur only in the offline model, with no instructions to adjust physical cooling equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「GROMACS：PME 分工與科學精度下的負載平衡」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付七種分工帳本、雙支線時間圖、精度比對及不可行分工的排除理由。","differenceEn":"Investigate GROMACS: PME partitioning under a scientific accuracy contract using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver a seven-partition ledger, branch timelines, numerical accuracy comparisons and explicit rejection reasons for unsupported decompositions, with all timing values labeled as synthetic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學固定壓頭 H 與二次阻力模型為 H=(K1+K2)q²，因此 q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2))；真實泵浦曲線與流態需另建模；H=100 kPa，K 單位 kPa/(L/min)²；K1=1，K2 由 3 增為 8；名義式 sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min；變更式 sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","分別寫出 6/2 的 12、20 ms 與 4/4 的 18、10 ms；加 3 ms 後比較，而不是把支線時間相加。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With a fixed teaching head H and quadratic resistance, H=(K1+K2)q², giving q=sqrt(H/(K1+K2)). Real pump curves, fluid properties and flow regimes require separate characterization. Set H to 100 kPa and express K in kPa/(L/min)². K1 remains 1 while K2 increases from 3 to 8. These invented coefficients represent an educational operating-point model, not an OCP product curve. Nominal sqrt(100/(1+3)) = 5 L/min; changed sqrt(100/(1+8)) = 3.33333333333 L/min. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Calculate PP and PME times separately for both allocations. Identify which branch determines each join, add the fixed exchange once, and compare the resulting times without summing concurrent branch durations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b5275ae878ccc1e5","url":"https://instinct.docs.amd.com/projects/dc-design/latest/index.html","title":"Data Center Design Guide","titleEn":"Data Center Design Guide","publisher":"AMD","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-dc87e074bf730bac","url":"https://github.com/gromacs/gromacs/blob/main/docs/user-guide/mdrun-performance.rst","title":"GROMACS mdrun performance guide","titleEn":"GROMACS mdrun performance guide","publisher":"GROMACS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
